  "body": "https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org/#exit-fullscreen\n\nAt the very end, it seems like \"Let element be exitDoc's fullscreen element\" and \"Unfullscreen element within exitDoc\" ought to be equivalent to \"unfullscreen exitDoc\" given the current definition of [collect ancestors](https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org/#collect-ancestors).\n\nAs written, a reader (like me) might otherwise wonder if _exitDoc_ could have any fullscreen element after the steps or not.\n",
